# NOTE: `results/` is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The repository ships frozen reference outputs (OOF parquet, metric CSV/JSON,
# paper tables) so that reviewers can verify claims without re-running the
# full 15-fold cross-validation. Re-running scripts/01-05 regenerates them.
